    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3020" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăpīcĭus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		apis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>sought by bees</i>, <i>liked by bees;</i> hence,
				<i>sweet</i>, <i>dainty</i>, =  apianus, q. v.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uvae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 24, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 58</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 14, 4,
				5, § 46</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 2,
			16</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăpīcĭum</span></b> ,
			i, n., sc. vinum,
				<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 6, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 25</span></i>.</div>
